rting. Set to false (or omit) to run in parallel. Use true when this tool depends on the output of previous tools.\"}},\"title\":\"list_data_itemsArguments\"}},{\"name\":\"mcp_ghidra_list_strings\",\"description\":\"List defined strings with their addresses, optionally filtered by a case-insensitive\\n        substring of the content.\",\"parametersJsonSchema\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"offset\":{\"default\":0,\"title\":\"Offset\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"limit\":{\"default\":200,\"title\":\"Limit\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"filter\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"type\":\"string\"},{\"type\":\"null\"}],\"default\":null,\"title\":\"Filter\"},\"wait_for_previous\":{\"type\":\"boolean\",\"description\":\"Set to true to wait for all previously requested tools in this turn to complete before starting. Set to false (or omit) to run in parallel. Use true when this tool depends on the output of previous tools.\"}},\"title\":\"list_stringsArguments\"}},{\"name\":\"mcp_ghidra_get_function_by_address\",\"description\":\"Get the function at or containing an address: name, signature, body range,\\n        calling convention.\",\"parametersJsonSchema\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"address\":{\"title\":\"Address\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"wait_for_previous\":{\"type\":\"boolean\",\"description\":\"Set to true to wait for all previously requested tools in this turn to complete before starting. Set to false (or omit) to run in parallel. Use true when this tool depends on the output of previous tools.\"}},\"required\":[\"address\"],\"title\":\"get_function_by_addressArguments\"}},{\"name\":\"mcp_ghidra_get_current_address\",\"description\":\"Get the address currently selected in the Ghidra GUI listing.\",\"parametersJsonSchema\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"wait_for_previous\":{\"type\":\"boolean\",\"description\":\"Set to true to wait for all previously requested tools in this turn to complete before starting. Set to false (or omit) to run in parallel. Use true when thi